{"steamid": "76561199061339463", "personaname": "bingubanana", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bingubun/", "num_games_owned": 27, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 165, "last_played": 1718562590, "avatar": "cca25a9af3e876e7b31ac9da434fadd381dc3ad4"}, "language": "english", "review": "so pro\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1682841770, "timestamp_updated": 1682841770, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "137529665", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023431594", "personaname": "Kingsania", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kingsania/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 503, "last_played": 1688267249, "avatar": "6204841bd1d8016291069941452f79f1e3cd1732"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you've played EDF 4.1, I wouldn't recommend this game as it doesn't offer anything revolutionary. That being said, I personally really enjoy this game [i]because[/i] I played 4.1 a bit. There are some quality of life improvements that simply made the cost worthwhile to me, improved graphics/hud display, distance to picking up crates feels more forgiving (and ranger gets some stuff to increase their pickup radius).\n\nThe absolutely most important two changes are with the armor/weapon crates. If a weapon already exists in your selection, then picking up a duplicate weapon tends to upgrade said weapon. And, you do not need to be playing a class to receive weapons and armor points for said class, it just happens. This particular change makes it feel so much better to try out new tactics or swap classes midway through the missions. I don't feel committed to a class choice when I play with friends and it makes the grinding feel way more impactful.\n\nBasically if you want to try the gameplay experience, go get 4.1, it's way cheaper. If you're looking for a timesink, get EDF 5 on a sale.", "timestamp_created": 1682829933, "timestamp_updated": 1682829933, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 23, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.679408729076385498", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 14, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "137521360", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996229068", "personaname": "VenomXII", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197996229068/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 2539, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 406, "deck_playtime_at_review": 208, "last_played": 1702500761, "avatar": "38a0de621cc455d0388c8e7a99e8229b2e228ea9"}, "language": "english", "review": "its pretty dope\nits a chill arcade shooter if there ever was one\nmoreover, the game doesn't take it self seriously and is over the top in every way imaginable.\nits ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ awesome.\nthe dialog is hilarious", "timestamp_created": 1682817415, "timestamp_updated": 1682817415, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}